     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Dear Reader,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I am trying to follow the steps on the methylKit page on Googlle Code.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I have read in my samples using the read.bismark function and now try to unite the methylation calls.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">However, I just get the following error:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue;background:#e1e2e5\">&gt; </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue;background:#e1e2e5\">meth = unite(myobj, destrand=TRUE)<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b;background:#e1e2e5\">Error in setkeyv(copy(y), by) : <u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b;background:#e1e2e5\">  4 arguments passed to .Internal(nchar) which requires 3</span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;background:#e1e2e5\"><u></u><u></u></span></pre>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">and am thus kind of stuck…<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">I trace the error back to the </span>‘ data.table’  <span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">function used in </span>‘ <span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue;background:#e1e2e5\">.CpG.dinuc.unify’<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue;background:#e1e2e5\">( .CpG.dinuc.unifyOld  </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black;background:#e1e2e5\">does work, but then later on data.table is used more often…)<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black;background:#e1e2e5\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black;background:#e1e2e5\">Any help is appreciated!<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black;background:#e1e2e5\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black;background:#e1e2e5\">Regards,<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black;background:#e1e2e5\">Aldo Jongejan</span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;background:#e1e2e5\"><u></u><u></u></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue;background:#e1e2e5\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;background:#e1e2e5\"><u></u>